  "_comment_join": "Words that bind two items into ONE bill line — a blend the customer buys as a single thing. Note these are the same words that mean 'and': a shopkeeper saying 'A மற்றும் B' for a coffee blend means one line, so they JOIN here rather than separate. English 'and' still separates, because 'two kilo sugar and one kilo onion' is two items.",
